INCANTATION fib n

  FOG GATE n YIELDS TO 2
    OFFER REMEMBRANCE n
  LIFT FOG

  INSCRIBE a 0
  INSCRIBE b 1
  INSCRIBE i 2

  ERDTREE LOOP
    FOG GATE i EXCEEDS n
      FELL THE TREE
    LIFT FOG
    INSCRIBE tmp b
    KINDLE tmp a
    INSCRIBE a b
    INSCRIBE b tmp
    KINDLE i 1
  ROOTS END

  OFFER REMEMBRANCE b

GRACE BESTOWED


SEEK GRACE

  ECHO "~ The Fibonacci Remembrance ~"

  INSCRIBE idx 0

  ERDTREE LOOP
    FOG GATE idx EXCEEDS 14
      FELL THE TREE
    LIFT FOG

    CAST fib idx
    ECHO _result

    KINDLE idx 1
  ROOTS END

OFFER REMEMBRANCE
